<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>marionette</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">confetti</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">weapon party</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0a874zJEhXkXZawtZWumKd</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.593" end="00:19.189">Yeah, yeah, I'm lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.189" end="00:21.892">Oh yeah, oh yeah, oh yeah (Try see)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.892" end="00:24.040">Oh yeah, oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.040" end="00:25.540">Oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.173" end="00:26.673">Oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.833" end="00:27.541">It ain't love if you ain't mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.541" end="00:29.798">Hold my hand for a long, long time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.798" end="00:31.945">Said "You've been a bad boy, you be good"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.945" end="00:34.781">Knits and paper, you're my prize</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.781" end="00:37.408">Yes, yeah (Huh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.408" end="00:38.908">Yeah, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.473" end="00:41.494" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I won't attack, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.494" end="00:42.994">Yeah (Oh yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.792" end="00:44.908">I've done a lot for you, my bride</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.908" end="00:47.351">Frozen moments in time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.351" end="00:49.478">"So, was it real?" No, a lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.478" end="00:52.375">And now you're golden for life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.375" end="00:53.875" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.279" end="00:54.779" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.315" end="00:55.815" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.470" end="00:56.970" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.550" end="00:58.050" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I won't attack)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.807" end="00:58.307" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.041" end="00:59.541" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.975" end="01:00.475" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.156" end="01:01.656" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.592" end="01:02.092" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I won't attack)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.204" end="01:02.704" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.241" end="01:03.741" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.421" end="01:04.921" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.400" end="01:05.900" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.323" end="01:09.751" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I won't attack, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.751" end="01:12.804">Splinter, didn't care if I got a splinter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.804" end="01:14.938">No fears, no laws, just freedom</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.938" end="01:17.071">No tears, no bawls, just leave 'em (Huh, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.071" end="01:20.580">It all comes at one simple price</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.580" end="01:22.195">If it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.195" end="01:24.957">Okay, it might hurt your pride</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.957" end="01:28.957">Okay, it might hurt your pride</p></div></body></tt>